/**
 * Rank glyphs measured from real ClubWPT Gold screenshots.
 *
 * Card art is fixed, so these ship as defaults and the app reads a screenshot
 * with no setup. Each entry is a 24x32 normalised
 * signature, base64 of one byte per pixel.
 *
 * Several samples per rank are kept where screenshots offered them: the same
 * character at different card sizes normalises slightly differently, and extra
 * samples cost nothing at match time since scoring takes the best per rank.
 *
 * All thirteen ranks are covered. Several samples per rank are kept where the
 * screenshots offered them, since the same character at different card sizes
 * normalises slightly differently and extra samples cost nothing at match time.
 */

